      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the centralization, in a single location, of the processing of applications and requests for such approvals, clearances, certifications and validations and the merger of certain inspection functions in connection therewith will eliminate waste and duplication and provide expeditious service to the public;",
