      "text": "2. In each borough office of the Department of Buildings, there shall be established a branch of such Division which shall be staffed with such personnel of the Division as the Deputy Mayor-City Administrator may deem necessary for performance of the functions of the Division in such borough. Such personnel shall perform their",
